     "tipo": "explicacion",
     "titulo": "Repairing the interaction",
     "texto": [
      "If the question is broad, ask for clarification: **Mener du kostnad eller tidsplan?**. If you don't know a figure, define what you do know and commit to checking it only if you can: **Det må jeg undersøke nærmere**. Don't present an assumption as an answer."
     ],
